  "instance_name": "Inspiration_porn_pity_narratives",
  "label": "Inspiration porn/pity narratives",
  "description": "This is a form of ableism that involves portraying people with disabilities or trauma as inspirational or heroic for enduring suffering, often to evoke pity or admiration. The meme's message of forced positivity ('you can be happy and smiling in any situation') can be seen as a form of inspiration porn, as it frames the prisoners' happiness as admirable or virtuous, rather than acknowledging the trauma and suffering they endured.",
